    "name": "Hotel Offer Orchestrator",
    "description": "Complete API test collection for the Hotel Offer Orchestrator backend.\n\nIncludes tests for:\n- Hotel aggregation with deduplication\n- Price range filtering via Redis Sorted Sets\n- Supplier mock endpoints\n- Health check\n- Error cases (invalid params, unknown city)",
